    "chunk_text": "arode: witodlice ic m\u00e6g ma secgan, ac ic nat, hw\u00e6r se sy, se \u00fee hine Ic gelyfe, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6gn \u00fe\u00e6re ge\u00feylde sy mare, \u00feonne \u00fea wundru & \u00fea foretacnu. Hit gelamp sume d\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6t se abbud, se \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s arwur\u00f0an Honorates for\u00f0fore heold & h\u00e6fde & \u00fea for\u00feon \u00fee he n\u00e6fde gyrde hine mid to sleanne, \u00fea gefeng he \u00feone fotsceamol \u00e6t his reste & he \u00fea swa swi\u00fee geswungen gewat swigende to his agenre r\u00e6ste. \u00dea o\u00f0re d\u00e6ge h\u00e6fde Libertinus ane gemotstowe gecweden ymb sume neod\u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres, & \u00dea gemunde se abbud, hu swy\u00f0e se halga man w\u00e6s fram eallum mannum gelufod & gearod. \u00dea wende he, \u00fe\u00e6t he for \u00f0an teonan, \u00fee he him \u00fey \u00e6rran d\u00e6ge gedyde, mid ealle of \u00feam mynstre \u00dea acsode se abbud hine \u00feus cwe\u00feende: hwider wilt \u00feu gangan? Him \u00fea Libertinus andswarode: min f\u00e6der, ic h\u00e6fde gyrstand\u00e6ge gecweden & gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t ic nu & he \u00fea se abbud in his heortan ingehigdum sceawode his sylfes re\u00f0nysse & his agene heardnysse. Gelice he eac gemunde \u00fea mycclan eadmodnysse & man\u00few\u00e6rnysse Libertines, & \u00fea hra\u00fee astylde Ong\u00e6n \u00fean eac Libertinus hine sylfne to \u00fe\u00e6s abbudes fotum astrehte, & he s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t hit his sylfes &",
